language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit UiCommandCoordinator.
capability CorrelatedUiCommands.
functionality SubmitUiCommand.
functionality RecoverUiCommand.
functionality ReconcileUiCommandResult.
functionality ClassifyUiRouting.

UIRuntime contains UiCommandCoordinator.
UiCommandCoordinator provides CorrelatedUiCommands.
UiCommandCoordinator status proposed.
UiCommandCoordinator cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
UiCommandCoordinator owns SubmitUiCommand.
SubmitUiCommand realizes CorrelatedUiCommands.
SubmitUiCommand specifies "Assign identity for a deliberate new action; retain initiating surface, expected revision and observed lifecycle.".
UiCommandCoordinator owns RecoverUiCommand.
RecoverUiCommand realizes CorrelatedUiCommands.
RecoverUiCommand specifies "Ambiguous transport result stays unknown; same-ID lookup/retry, conflict and expiry distinct; no automatic replacement ID.".
UiCommandCoordinator owns ReconcileUiCommandResult.
ReconcileUiCommandResult realizes CorrelatedUiCommands.
ReconcileUiCommandResult specifies "Route durable result to initiating context even if a view changes or disappears.".
UiCommandCoordinator owns ClassifyUiRouting.
ClassifyUiRouting realizes CorrelatedUiCommands.
ClassifyUiRouting specifies "Distinguish no handler, handler failure, intentional ignore and no visible view; bounded diagnostics cannot recursively report themselves.".
